{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121631","id":4106765932,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc70yEZs","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121631","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121631.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121631.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121631","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121631/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121631/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121631/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4e584fc7fb866f2c701904dcc92b8453071f8529","number":121631,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Allow integer index access on Quaternion","user":{"login":"devtejasx","id":180245225,"node_id":"U_kgDOCr5S6Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180245225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx","html_url":"https://github.com/devtejasx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #120318.\n\n### Root cause\n\nIn `GDScriptAnalyzer::reduce_subscript()`, `Variant::QUATERNION` was grouped with the types that accept a String index only (alongside `Rect2`, `Plane`, `AABB` and `Object`), so an integer index was rejected at parse time:\n\n```\nInvalid index type \"int\" for a base of type \"Quaternion\".\n```\n\nThis contradicts the analyzer itself: a little further down, the same function already resolves the result of indexing a `Quaternion` to `float`, which only makes sense for integer indexing. `Quaternion` also provides `operator[](int)` in `core/math/quaternion.h`, and the documented `operator []` behaviour expects an int. Other types backed by the same kind of accessor — `Basis` and the `Vector` family — are already in the group that accepts a String *or* a number.\n\nThanks to @AThousandShips for pinpointing this in the issue thread.\n\n### Fix\n\nMove `Variant::QUATERNION` into the \"Expect String or number\" group. String indexing (`quaternion[\"z\"]`) is unaffected, and no other type changes group.\n\n### Testing\n\nAdded `modules/gdscript/tests/scripts/analyzer/features/quaternion_subscript.gd`, covering a constant integer index, a variable integer index, and a String index.\n\nVerified it reproduces the bug. On `master` without the fix:\n\n```\nGDTEST_ANALYZER_ERROR\n>> ERROR at line 6: Invalid index type \"int\" for a base of type \"Quaternion\".\n>> ERROR at line 7: Invalid index type \"int\" for a base of type \"Quaternion\".\n>> ERROR at line 11: Invalid index type \"int\" for a base of type \"Quaternion\".\n```\n\nNote the String index on the last line is not reported, matching the issue description. With the fix applied the full suite passes:\n\n```\n[doctest] test cases:   1411 |   1411 passed | 0 failed | 3 skipped\n[doctest] assertions: 421209 | 421209 passed | 0 failed |\n```\n\nBuilt with GCC 15.2 (MinGW/UCRT64) on Windows, `target=editor tests=yes`. Clean under clang-format 22.1.5.\n\n### Out of scope\n\nThe issue thread also notes that `Transform3D` sits in the opposite wrong group — it accepts an integer index in the analyzer but has no subscript operator, so it fails at runtime rather than at parse time. That is a separate behavioural change and is deliberately left out of this PR.\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-22T09:08:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T09:10:01Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T09:09:57Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"72ac9472a2b88cc0e0b2f50e7d6ccb47c0330fe9","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"devtejasx:fix-quaternion-subscript-index","ref":"fix-quaternion-subscript-index","repo":{"id":1308504818,"node_id":"R_kgDOTf4y8g","name":"godot","full_name":"devtejasx/godot","owner":{"login":"devtejasx","id":180245225,"node_id":"U_kgDOCr5S6Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180245225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx","html_url":"https://github.com/devtejasx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Godot Engine – Multi-platform 2D 